[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3732595023","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114761#issuecomment-3732595023","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114761","id":3732595023,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eeuFP","user":{"login":"LucaTuerk","id":15263030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjYzMDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15263030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk","html_url":"https://github.com/LucaTuerk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LucaTuerk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T12:40:13Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T12:40:13Z","body":"**My Findings:**\n\nThe order of execution is as follows:\n\n* **(SCRIPT)** set_position\n* **SceneTree::physics_process**\n    * **(SCRIPT)** _physics_process(...): _get_gravity_ receives the previous gravity value\n    * **CollisionObject3D::_notification**: receives NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED and sets the state on GodotBody2D through _flush_transform_notifications_\n    * **GodotBody2D::set_state**: As CharacterBody2D is KINEMATIC the transform is written to the _new_transform_ backing field and not propagated to the actual body transform.\n* **GodotBody2D::integrate_forces**: Recalculates the gravity using the actual body transform which still holds the previous value.\n* **GodotBody2D::integrate_velocities**: The actual body transform is set to _new_transform_.\n\nOne frame delay is therefore explained by integrate_forces being called after _physics_process, this is desired as any changes mad in this frame are directly applied. The other due to the use of the actual body transform instead of new_transform in the gravity calculation.\n\nI'm not sure about all the ins and outs, but I hope this helps.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3732595023/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734808404","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114761#issuecomment-3734808404","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114761","id":3734808404,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7enKdU","user":{"login":"Cyberhead21","id":126357372,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4gPfA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126357372?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyberhead21","html_url":"https://github.com/Cyberhead21","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyberhead21/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyberhead21/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyberhead21/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyberhead21/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyberhead21/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyberhead21/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyberhead21/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyberhead21/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyberhead21/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T15:26:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T15:26:42Z","body":"I have loaded up the project in 4.5.1.stable on an x86 Windows and Linux laptop and the problem also exists on these platforms as well, so it isn't a Mac-specific or an architecture-specific issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734808404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]